frame export beside the accepted original-main scene gate. Original glSendFrame
owns view submission, framebuffer copy, swap and VI delivery. The normal game
source is unchanged; the complete original task loop remains pending.

diff --git a/src/Game/main.cpp b/src/Game/main.cpp
--- a/src/Game/main.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/main.cpp
@@ -933,3 +933,19 @@
     glx_SendEnd();
 }
 #endif
